# Base URL of the Songbird backend (FastAPI /identify).
# Leave empty for local dev (frontend + backend on the same origin).
# On Vercel, set this to your deployed backend URL, e.g. https://your-backend.hf.space
#
# WARNING: every VITE_-prefixed var is compiled into the public browser bundle
# and visible to anyone. Never put a secret (API key, token, password) here.
VITE_API_BASE=
